> 3) On about level 25 I got to a level filled with water. How do you cross the
>    water? I had one potion of levetation, but that only got me halfway
>    across. Is there anyway to get a swimming instrisic?

     There is no swimming intrinsic.  Humans (and elves) can't swim.  A
     common theme in games, it seems.  Well, you are lugging a lot of 
     stuff.  Levitation is a good way across; either mutiple potions,
     one blessed potion, a ring, boots, or a spellbook will do.  You 
     might want to come back sometime, so I'd recommend finding a 
     more permanent method than the potion.  (Which, BTW, you can dilute
     while over the water to make water.  You'll need lots of holy 
     water later.)  Water walking is also good, obviously.  You can
     also polymorph yourself into something that can fly or swim.  Or 
     you could push a whole lot of boulders into the water and make a 
     bridge, but that would be kind of tedious.  

     By the way, this level is sort of special.  An even stinkier 
